WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Check the actual module
Open the feature guide and inspect runtime capabilities. CC1101, PN532 and IR have different limits. Optional radios need compatible hardware.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Start with inspection
Use a saved sample, a disposable tag or a known lab signal. Read the selected protocol and operation before proceeding. Write and erase change the target.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Separate reply from effect
An accepted command does not prove a receiver reacted. Physical output requires a controlled test and an independent observation.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Record the boundary
Record app and firmware versions, peripheral, expected result and observed result. Keep blocked and not-run tests distinct from passes.
